<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li>About</li></ol>
    <h1>A bridge, not a bank.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Stone Bridge Funding Group is a business funding broker. We stand between owners who need capital and the funders who provide it, and we get paid only when the two connect.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <p>Banks are built to say no slowly. They want three years of returns, collateral, and six weeks. Most small businesses need an answer this week and do not have a spare warehouse to pledge.</p>
    <p>We work with funding partners who underwrite on revenue and recent bank activity instead. That means an owner with $40,000 a month in deposits and an average credit score can get a real offer in a day — and see it next to two others before deciding.</p>
    <div class="pull">One application. Multiple offers. A person on the phone who has read your statements.</div>
    <h2>How we get paid</h2>
    <p>The funding partner pays us a placement fee when a deal funds. On most products that fee is built into the offer, so there is no invoice from us. If a product carries a fee to you directly, you see it in writing before you sign. We do not charge to apply, to be matched, or to compare offers.</p>
    <p>This matters because it aligns us with you: we only earn on deals that close, and deals only close when the terms are ones you are willing to sign. Pushing a bad offer costs us the relationship and the renewal.</p>
    <h2>What we are not</h2>
    <p>We are not a lender, and we do not pretend to be. We do not hold your money, service your account, or set your rate. The funding partner does. Our job is to know which partner will say yes to your file, get you there fast, and make sure you understand what you are signing.</p>
    <h2>Who we work with</h2>
    <p>Contractors, restaurants, trucking companies, medical practices, retailers, e-commerce sellers, auto shops, salons, and hundreds of other main-street businesses. If you have been operating for six months and deposit at least $10,000 a month, there is probably something we can do.</p>
    <p>We also work with brokers and ISOs who bring us their files. <a href="/brokers">Details on that program are here.</a></p>
    <h2>Reach us</h2>
    <p>Call <a href="<%= site.phoneHref %>"><%= site.phone %></a>, email <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a>, or <a href="/contact">send a message</a>. Hours are <%= site.hours %>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
